Underlying market quotes remain the property of the relevant exchanges and index providers. They are redistributed here only as a convenience for academic replication. Official S&P GICS sector total-return indices are proprietary; this package uses publicly quoted sector ETFs as research proxies.

The Fama-French 12 industry daily portfolios are produced by the Ken French Data Library. Please cite that library when using the ff12 files:

https://mba.tuck.dartmouth.edu/pages/faculty/ken.french/data_library.html
